{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "text-glitch",
  "title": "文字故障",
  "description": "用于给文字叠加彩色错位故障（glitch）动画的文字效果组件。",
  "category": "effect",
  "tags": [
    "css",
    "tailwind"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "text",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "展示故障效果的文字内容。",
      "default": "\"\""
    },
    {
      "name": "speed",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "故障动画的速度（秒）。",
      "default": "0.5"
    },
    {
      "name": "enableShadows",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "description": "是否开启彩色阴影以增强故障感。",
      "default": "true"
    },
    {
      "name": "enableOnHover",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "description": "为 `true` 时仅在悬停时启用故障动画。",
      "default": "false"
    },
    {
      "name": "class",
      "type": "HTMLAttributes[\"class\"]",
      "required": false,
      "description": "容器 div 的额外 CSS 类。",
      "default": "undefined"
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "slots": [],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "code": "<template>\n  <div class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-lg p-4\">\n    <TextGlitch :speed=\"1\" :enable-shadows=\"true\" text=\"Reborn UI\" />\n  </div>\n</template>\n",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "赛博朋克、科技风页面的标题文字。",
    "404 页或错误提示的风格化文案。",
    "需要仅在悬停时触发故障动画的交互文字（enableOnHover）。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "悬停时字符快速乱变重排，改用 hyper-text。",
    "多彩渐变文字，改用 colourful-text。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用。",
    "文字通过 text prop 传入，不支持插槽。",
    "enableOnHover 默认 false（动画常驻），设为 true 后仅悬停触发。",
    "speed 单位为秒（默认 0.5），enableShadows 控制彩色阴影（默认开启）。"
  ],
